{"ID":"20240220132605-jqy1p96","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132605-jqy1p96","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132605-jqy1p96\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171328-2bv6k6x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171328-swkq8b2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171328-swkq8b2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:77,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:77\u0026#125;","title":"【附子汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312171328"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312171328-2bv6k6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171328-2bv6k6x","updated":"20240312171328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百一十九条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171328-80xthek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171328-80xthek","updated":"20240312171328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：【少阴病】，身体痛，手足痛，骨节痛，脉沉者，【附子汤】主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171328-akandyx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171328-akandyx","updated":"20240312171328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“身体痛，骨节痛，脉浮紧”标准的麻黄汤症。但手足痛，脉沉者，病在里，寒湿在里面。如故寒在表的时候，单是一个寒，是麻黄汤。寒湿在里造成身体痛，骨节痛的时候，肌肉痛，这个时候用附子汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171328-63g2l1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171328-63g2l1z","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"附子汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171328-xz2fn00","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171328-xz2fn00","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"附子二枚，炮，破八片。茯苓三两。人参二两。白术四两。芍药三两。右五味，以水八升，煮取三升，去渣，温服一升，日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171328-sbaz4zw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171328-sbaz4zw","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"附子二枚，就是六钱，重用附子。茯苓三钱。人参二钱。白术四钱。芍药三钱。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171328-tvd2o1w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171328-tvd2o1w","updated":"20240312171328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里白术比茯苓多一点点。这里如果把人参，换成生姜就是真武汤。真武汤症是下焦有寒水，头会昏眩，头重脚轻的症状，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"真武是一个神，专门管世界上的水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。真武汤用茯苓用的比较多，白术用的比较少，因为它要把水排掉。这个附子汤不是，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"附子汤是要去寒去湿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以它要靠大剂的炮附子下去，白术去湿，茯苓加一点不要加太多，让它慢慢出来，同时人参怕津液伤到，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"少阴症只可以利尿，不可以发表"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，也不可以攻下，里面是寒湿的。芍药温补。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171328-k4k51dh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171328-k4k51dh","updated":"20240312171328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当血有问题的时候芍药，气有问题的时候人参。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"附子能够同时管心脏管肾脏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。白术茯苓把中间的湿去掉，因为病本来是由太阴进到少阴的，所以进来后脾和肺是两虚，所以用人参来补肺，白芍来补脾。张仲景最多到这个阶段，不会开滋阴的药开很多。开很多，病人虚的话，病人不但不会接受，反而是负担，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"药简力专"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。他这五味药把"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"心肾脾肺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"统统解决掉了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171328-swkq8b2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171328-swkq8b2","updated":"20240312171328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里身体会痛是虚痛，里面寒湿很盛的时候造成的痛，所以用附子汤。附子汤附子用三钱，就没有用了，这里身体痛脉沉，最主要是寒症，去寒的药加的不够，没有办法化掉。"}]}]}